   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet st&#xE4;rker Association of Free Towns and Municipalities, AFTM, i Serbien. St&#xF6;det inneb&#xE4;r utveckling av en hemsida f&#xF6;r AFTM f&#xF6;r dess medlemmar och f&#xF6;r att fr&#xE4;mja projekthanteringskapaciteten. Svensk implementerande part &#xE4;r Swedish Association of Local Authorities, SALA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening the capacity of the Association of Free Towns and Municipalities, AFTM, in Serbia (FRY). The implemen- tation partner and project coordinator will be the Swedish Associationof Local Authorities, SALA. Support will be given to develop a websitefor AFTM and its members and to enhance the project coord. capacity.</narrative>
